        "reviewedAt": "2026-10-16T18:54:46.347264+00:00",
        "reviewer": "/root/chemie_native9_fresh_independent_a_20261016",
        "reason": "Actual full P compares specified ethene addition and Lewis-acid-assisted first benzene substitution and corrects permanentC6H6Br2 versusC6H5Br+HBr. Benzene4bdb supports restored aromaticity and reaction preference; O2/N2MO routine is not a necessary prior. Both other actual reaction priors remain. Source/course/prior contexts were independently read, not inferred from globaltags. Own current-context synthesis tmp/chemie-m7-resumed-20261016/HE-final-six-P-current-context-independent-a-v1/FIRST.own-final-six-P-current-context.before-record-serialization.json sha256:67ffb7e96e5c9abce5d06260753f92276d67c117a1d7071fe8d46e4785420cf6; original frozen whole-context science tmp/chemie-m7-resumed-20261016/HE-admission-current-independent-a-v1/FIRST.exact-HE-seven-wholes-four-views-source-and-admission.independent-a.science.frozen.json sha256:6a7f4dc40b4639ceb61849724b88a8cc644ea8dd1f7f163e148ddc47cc04b2ed. Whole profile/cases/criteria and unchanged actual resourcebytes retained. New own review identity/date bind the actual current requires/tags; no historical reviewer is reassigned. No new formalD/V/human/learner/whole-course acceptance is claimed.",
