        "reason": "Exact unchanged accepted whole profile from content input /home/enpasos/projects/skillpilot/tmp/chemie-m7-resumed-20261016/joint-reviewed-pending-eight-Memory-source-and-four-V-technical-merge-preparer-v1/PROPOSAL.a76-actual-qualitative-profile.pending-current-stock-bindings.json @ sha256:dd82fc2cae8dceed225e10bcf360f7d3472a109858e6feba224c4c715683805d; paired science: tmp/chemie-m7-resumed-20261016/bounded-memory-and-source-successor-independent-a-v1/FIRST.SOURCE.md @ sha256:99c1ccf729c2b284261f8f3dff99d3a1e7cd6ca0c15b5cf113467132f4fc84f1; tmp/chemie-m7-resumed-20261016/bounded-source-ten-P1-successor-independent-b-v1/FIRST.bounded-source-ten-P1-independent-b.json @ sha256:46946b73334100822c9d4cbee68826492c95434b0aaf3cea75b5bc2e74328068. Actual current goal, reviewed-resource bytes and profile fingerprints computed by unchanged stock functions in this physical capsule. This is technical serialization, not a new scientific vote. Scoped source requirements and source optionality remain separate exact-bound context. Isolated inactive L7 candidate only; no new independent science or formal reviewRunId; no Human Approval, Human Trial, current native-D or M7 claim.",
        "evidenceLevel": "E1",
