        "reason": "Technical current-candidate serialization of the exact retained whole profile and informed current context. Scientific content pins: /home/enpasos/projects/skillpilot/tmp/chemie-m7-resumed-20261016/current24-targeted-P-context-scientific-informed-b-v1/REVIEW.informed-24-whole-P-contexts-and-T05-material-selection.B.json @ sha256:c4664c31fe44cd4ba5a56dee856e25d7e8ad5ba364edf586326585f92b9cf968. Original reviewId and own original criteria namespace retained; prior whole records archived. Fingerprints use actual unchanged stock functions and physical resources in this isolated capsule. No new scientific vote, formal reviewRunId, observed practice, Human Approval, Human Trial, final scope/route pass or M7 claim. Existing performance requirements remain intact; final scope/acquisition and pending concentration-source cases remain separately open.",
