        "reason": "Technical exact-current-C20 successor after paired packages03/04. Whole profiles are from the exact guarded clean content and foreign reviews: clean03 @ sha256:069a01271849b934bc6caf2478a7758e4c34ee547174ff26a7bcf0530177062b; CAS03 @ sha256:663df4b0f691637798062654f910a7a5b5f2bb62a51a00e4a7f409e5ae732524; B03 @ sha256:a41ecb75713a69e9c6837651d8007807dfaaa81a74f00e880ce12986aeaa9bb5; rootInformed03 @ sha256:7b4d22faed312e709895b85c8a0fa8e48c81d90a660c4f7fe26804106e063cbc. Package03 B sealed its own FIRST; root second review is explicitly informed, not blind FIRST or formal native-D. Original reviewId, own criteria and actual old reviewRunIds are retained. cc5a changes exactly8 terminology leaves;188 changes exactly1 German task leaf, with its separately reviewed narrower requires edge. All figures, EN demands, expected performances, transfers and practice limits are protected. Actual stock P fingerprints use this physical private capsule and real unchanged resource bytes. No new formal/native run ID, learner evidence, experiment, Human Approval, host acceptance or M7 claim. Official optionality and broader own-acquisition scope remain distinct; final P/M/native/central acceptance remains open.",
